<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"> <id>https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/</id><title>Pragmatic Dev Note</title><subtitle>Salesforce(Apex, LWC, Flow, Architecture) 심층 가이드 및 최신 IT·클라우드 개발 기술 블로그</subtitle> <updated>2026-11-27T15:47:48+09:00</updated> <author> <name>Pragmatic Dev</name> <uri>https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/</uri> </author><link rel="self" type="application/atom+xml" href="https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/feed.xml"/><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="ko-KR" href="https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/"/> <generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator> <rights> © 2026 Pragmatic Dev </rights> <icon>/pr-preview/pr-3/assets/img/favicons/favicon.ico</icon> <logo>/pr-preview/pr-3/assets/img/favicons/favicon-96x96.png</logo> <entry><title>Salesforce 개발자 문서의 AI 친화적 변화: llms.txt와 Markdown 파이프라인 활용법</title><link href="https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/posts/bring-salesforce-developer-docs-into-your-ai-tools/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Salesforce 개발자 문서의 AI 친화적 변화: llms.txt와 Markdown 파이프라인 활용법" /><published>2026-11-27T15:47:03+09:00</published> <updated>2026-11-27T15:47:03+09:00</updated> <id>https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/posts/bring-salesforce-developer-docs-into-your-ai-tools/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/posts/bring-salesforce-developer-docs-into-your-ai-tools/" /> <author> <name>Pragmatic Dev</name> </author> <category term="Salesforce" /> <category term="Tech Insights" /> <summary>Salesforce 공식 문서에 추가된 Markdown 제공 기능과 llms.txt 인덱스를 활용하여 Cursor, ChatGPT, Claude 등 AI 에이전트의 코드 생성 정확도를 극대화하는 실무 가이드입니다.</summary> </entry> <entry><title>실무 중심 비동기 Apex 완전 정복: @future 한계부터 Queueable 체이닝, Batch Apex 주의점까지</title><link href="https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/posts/salesforce-asynchronous-apex-future-queueable-batch/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="실무 중심 비동기 Apex 완전 정복: @future 한계부터 Queueable 체이닝, Batch Apex 주의점까지" /><published>2026-11-25T16:05:00+09:00</published> <updated>2026-11-25T17:29:06+09:00</updated> <id>https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/posts/salesforce-asynchronous-apex-future-queueable-batch/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/posts/salesforce-asynchronous-apex-future-queueable-batch/" /> <author> <name>Pragmatic Dev</name> </author> <category term="Salesforce" /> <category term="Apex" /> <summary>왜 실무에서 @future 대신 Queueable을 써야 할까? 체이닝 불가 에러 해결부터 Queueable 연쇄 실행, Batch Apex 청크 사이즈 및 Stateful 힙 메모리 함정까지 현업 코드로 정리합니다.</summary> </entry> <entry><title>실무 중심 Apex Trigger &amp; Handler 설계와 Bulkification 가이드 (feat. TriggerSwitch 패턴)</title><link href="https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/posts/salesforce-apex-trigger-framework-best-practices/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="실무 중심 Apex Trigger &amp;amp; Handler 설계와 Bulkification 가이드 (feat. TriggerSwitch 패턴)" /><published>2026-11-25T13:41:54+09:00</published> <updated>2026-11-25T15:01:50+09:00</updated> <id>https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/posts/salesforce-apex-trigger-framework-best-practices/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://taeyeonimda.github.io/pr-preview/pr-3/posts/salesforce-apex-trigger-framework-best-practices/" /> <author> <name>Pragmatic Dev</name> </author> <category term="Salesforce" /> <category term="Apex" /> <summary>현업 Salesforce 프로젝트에서 가장 많이 쓰는 직관적인 Trigger + Handler + TriggerSwitch 설계 패턴부터 200건 청크 함정 방지(try-finally), Bulkification까지 실전 코드로 정리합니다.</summary> </entry> </feed>
